### Security & RBAC Implementation

> [!CAUTION]
> Security is paramount. The CRM will implement layered security:
> - **API Level**: Every internal CRM route will run through an RBAC dependency that validates the JWT, the user's internal role, and whether they own the requested resource or have an override role (like Founder).
> - **Data Scrubbing**: API responses for deals/properties will omit sensitive financial fields (e.g., commissions) if the requesting employee does not have clearance.
> - **Audit Logs**: Every mutation (create/update/assign) will write to an immutable audit log collection.

