### Automated Tests
- Create Python/pytest tests in `backend/tests/test_crm_rbac.py` asserting that executives cannot access other executives' leads (403 Forbidden).
- Test commission visibility rules for varying roles.
- Test that duplicate lead numbers throw appropriate conflicts.

### Manual Verification
- Seed the database with demo users for all 5 roles (`founder@visitsarva.com`, `executive@...`, etc.).
- Log into the UI as each role to verify dashboard visibility.
- Walk through the entire business process manually: `Lead -> Requirement -> Property Match -> Site Visit -> Deal -> Commission`.
